# Density Compare
# Neon (Ne) — real density 0.0009 g/cm³. equal masses: Neon vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Neon Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 206.9mm color: #b3e3f5 at (-20mm, 103.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
